{"fps": 30, "frames": 1700, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 160, "text": "Imagine beating Wall Street for twenty-eight years from a desk in a closet.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 0, "e": 13}, {"w": "beating", "f": 16, "e": 22}, {"w": "Wall", "f": 24, "e": 31}, {"w": "Street", "f": 33, "e": 40}, {"w": "for", "f": 42, "e": 49}, {"w": "twenty-eight", "f": 53, "e": 64}, {"w": "years", "f": 69, "e": 80}, {"w": "from", "f": 89, "e": 93}, {"w": "a", "f": 96, "e": 98}, {"w": "desk", "f": 100, "e": 113}, {"w": "in", "f": 116, "e": 117}, {"w": "a", "f": 118, "e": 120}, {"w": "closet.", "f": 122, "e": 150}]}, {"a": 160, "b": 345, "text": "New York, nineteen fifty-five. Walter Schloss skipped college but learned from Benjamin Graham.", "words": [{"w": "New", "f": 162, "e": 167}, {"w": "York,", "f": 169, "e": 184}, {"w": "nineteen", "f": 187, "e": 196}, {"w": "fifty-five.", "f": 198, "e": 233}, {"w": "Walter", "f": 234, "e": 242}, {"w": "Schloss", "f": 244, "e": 256}, {"w": "skipped", "f": 258, "e": 267}, {"w": "college", "f": 269, "e": 280}, {"w": "but", "f": 287, "e": 291}, {"w": "learned", "f": 293, "e": 300}, {"w": "from", "f": 302, "e": 307}, {"w": "Benjamin", "f": 309, "e": 318}, {"w": "Graham.", "f": 320, "e": 339}]}, {"a": 345, "b": 527, "text": "No tips. No connections. Just manuals, and over a hundred cheap, dull stocks.", "words": [{"w": "No", "f": 347, "e": 351}, {"w": "tips.", "f": 353, "e": 369}, {"w": "No", "f": 373, "e": 376}, {"w": "connections.", "f": 378, "e": 401}, {"w": "Just", "f": 407, "e": 411}, {"w": "manuals,", "f": 413, "e": 438}, {"w": "and", "f": 440, "e": 442}, {"w": "over", "f": 444, "e": 451}, {"w": "a", "f": 453, "e": 456}, {"w": "hundred", "f": 458, "e": 469}, {"w": "cheap,", "f": 473, "e": 487}, {"w": "dull", "f": 488, "e": 496}, {"w": "stocks.", "f": 498, "e": 513}]}, {"a": 527, "b": 627, "text": "Stocks so boring they'd put a cocktail party to sleep.", "words": [{"w": "Stocks", "f": 529, "e": 539}, {"w": "so", "f": 540, "e": 544}, {"w": "boring"